  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f988bc0d55107749a911c0375bba164, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dial_ProfCharker_FloodedBindery
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerNpcId: prof_charker
  playerFacingPolicy: 1
  lines:
  - speakerName: 
    text: One moment. If I don't write this down now, it'll wander off before I ever see my desk again
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 08e74a2ba7871d5489c461279793bb19, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof. Charker
    text: Professor Charker. Binding is my work. Bring me a book worth the ink, and I'll gladly put it through the press
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 08e74a2ba7871d5489c461279793bb19, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof. Charker
    text: It would have to wait, though. The basement is flooded, so the workshop has taken up swimming
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 08e74a2ba7871d5489c461279793bb19, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof. Charker
    text: The old sewer pipes are acting up again. That's the story I'm telling myself, anyway
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 08e74a2ba7871d5489c461279793bb19, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Prof. Charker
    text: Plumbers should be on their way. Check back once the water gets bored and leaves.
    typeSpeed: 48
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 08e74a2ba7871d5489c461279793bb19, type: 3}
    portraitTint: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 0}
      targetSource: 5
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
    choices: []
  autoAdvance: 0
  autoAdvanceDelay: 2
  allowSkip: 1
  skipToEndOfLine: 1
